@startuml feature_v0.7.0_F-009_sequence
' Runtime truth for F-009 v0.7.0 — CLI MCP Server and Agent Integrations
' Reversed from code at commit 92c2578a. Cast is the participants: list of feature_v0.7.0_F-009_front-matter.yaml, name for name.
title F-009 v0.7.0 — CLI MCP Server and Agent Integrations
autonumber

actor "Operator" as Operator
actor "AI agent" as AgentClient
participant "semantica.cli" as Cli
participant "mcp server" as Mcp
participant "mcp tool module" as Tool
participant "integration adapter" as Adapter
participant "ContextGraph or KG" as Core

group F-009-US1 — drive the whole system from a terminal
  Operator -> Cli : semantica kg build
  activate Cli
  Cli -> Core : build graph from sources (semantica/cli.py:1154)
  activate Core
  Core --> Cli : graph
  deactivate Core
  Cli --> Operator : summary
  Operator -> Cli : semantica kg query
  Cli -> Core : query
  Core --> Cli : rows
  deactivate Cli
end

group F-009-US2 — pipe CLI output into another tool
  Operator -> Cli : semantica kg query with JSON Lines output
  activate Cli
  Cli -> Cli : one record per line, bare dict wrapped in a list (semantica/cli.py:2338)
  Cli --> Operator : newline-delimited records
  deactivate Cli
end

group F-009-US3 — call graph and decision tools over MCP
  Operator -> Cli : semantica mcp start
  Cli -> Mcp : launch the same server module (semantica/cli.py:5407)
  activate Mcp
  AgentClient -> Mcp : tools/list
  Mcp --> AgentClient : tool descriptors
  AgentClient -> Mcp : tools/call by name
  Mcp -> Tool : dispatch (semantica_mcp/mcp/server.py:63)
  activate Tool
  Tool -> Core : read or write
  Core --> Tool : result
  Tool --> Mcp : payload
  deactivate Tool
  Mcp --> AgentClient : result
  deactivate Mcp
end

group F-009-US4 — use Semantica from agno, CrewAI or Google ADK
  AgentClient -> Adapter : tool invocation
  activate Adapter
  Adapter -> Adapter : take the per-graph re-entrant lock (integrations/crewai/kg_tool.py:56)
  Adapter -> Core : add entities and relations
  Core --> Adapter : nodes and edges added, duplicates skipped
  Adapter --> AgentClient : counts
  deactivate Adapter
end

group failure — tool raises an internal error
  Tool --> Mcp : exception
  Mcp -> Mcp : surface the class name, withhold str(exc) (semantica_mcp/mcp/server.py:115)
  Mcp --> AgentClient : error without paths or connection strings
end

group failure — rules file carries a present-but-non-list premises value
  Operator -> Cli : semantica reason run with that file
  Cli -> Cli : detect the wrong type (semantica/cli.py:1268)
  Cli --> Operator : clear error, no plain-text reinterpretation
end

group failure — two tool calls add the same node concurrently
  Adapter -> Adapter : per-graph re-entrant lock around check-then-act
  Adapter --> AgentClient : duplicate skipped, never double-counted
end

group failure — ADK emits a partial or streaming event
  AgentClient -> Adapter : partial event
  Adapter -> Adapter : return before touching events or state (integrations/google_adk/session_service.py:490)
  Adapter --> AgentClient : not persisted
end

group failure — payload carries many unrecognised keys
  Core -> Core : truncate each key, cap the key count (semantica/utils/helpers.py:702)
  Core --> Adapter : bounded error message
end

note over Mcp
  invariants: DOM-009-R1, DOM-009-R2, DOM-009-R3, DOM-009-R4, DOM-009-R5, DOM-009-R6
  concurrency: one re-entrant lock per graph (integrations/crewai/kg_tool.py:56)
  timeout: none documented - retry: none documented - idempotency: duplicate adds are skipped
end note

@enduml
